00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.420
but I'll spare her this time.

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:48.590
Hey!

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:49.840
Hold it!

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:54.800
It seems a cat has taken up residence on campus.

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:58.060
We've received reports from victims of its mischief.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:14:59.560
Hold it right there!

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:05.520
A lot of students feed it their
leftovers from lunch without thinking,

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.320
so now it can't get enough.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.820
<i>All</i> of you?!

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:16.450
We're somewhat responsible, so we should do something.

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:17.830
Cat!

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.830
Get down here!

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:21.710
Freaking cat!
Oh, didn't even need to look.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:22.290
It's up a tree.
Freaking cat!

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.580
Damn cat!
It's up a tree.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.670
Maybe we can lure it down with some foxtail.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:28.250
We don't have any.

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.710
Let's use something similar instead.

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:32.630
Not gonna work.

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.220
Wait for me-ow!

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:37.640
Leave it to me-ow!

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:39.720
Huh? What's that?

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:44.310
The best way to get a cat to understand you
is to think like one yourself!

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:44.980
Oh.

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:45.980
Meow!

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:47.860
She's not quite there yet.

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:49.900
There, meow!

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:51.440
Come to meow-mmy!

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:53.740
It's a very cute plan, I'll admit.

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:57.160
But what is that tail even attached to?!

00:15:57.990 --> 00:15:59.870
Meow meow, meow meow!

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.870
I'm just like you, meow!

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:04.250
Come on, meow meow!

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:06.250
Come on, meow!

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:12.420
See? It came down!

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.630
Good job, Aria!

00:16:16.180 --> 00:16:20.760
First we'll have to give it
a good scolding for its sins.

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:22.980
You little homewrecker!

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:25.020
So now he's cheating on her?

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.400
There, there.

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:31.570
Seems like it really likes us. What now?

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:33.650
I can keep it as a pet.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.610
Isn't Dejima-san allergic to animals?

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:38.530
My house is big, so no problem.

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:42.910
His wife and kids?

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:45.660
So he was providing for an entire family!

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:49.210
Is this what they mean by
"won the battle but lost the war"?

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:52.670
Honestly, there's no way
I'd feel inferior to a <i>cat</i>.

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:57.800
The Judo Club will be participating in the national interhigh competitions.

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:02.180
Let's hold a grand pep rally for them!

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.270
Sounds good.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:06.310
It'd be more exciting if we
had some surprises in store.

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.810
Surprises...

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:10.270
Like a slip of some sort?

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:11.190
Tsuda's, of course.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:12.820
I'm not gonna expose it.

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:13.610
Oh?

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:15.900
Care to elaborate what you mean by "it"?

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:18.740
We won't know unless you
tell us exactly what you mean!

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:21.830
Shouldn't our positions normally be reversed?

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:22.830
What's so funny?

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:27.960
We should begin soon.

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:29.750
Any of you need the bathroom?

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.590
You won't be able to go for a while.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:33.090
I'm good.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:34.840
Nah, I've already...

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:36.300
put some diapers on!

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:36.840
What?

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:42.300
The Judo Club pep rally will now begin!

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:49.480
Big official events like this make me nervous.

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:51.860
It's nothing once you get used to it.

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:53.190
Just take it easy.

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:55.110
Okay, I will.

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:59.360
Next, the Student Council President will give a speech.

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:00.070
badump

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.910
This is no time to be having pervy thoughts.

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:05.240
How'd you know?!

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:08.250
Ousai Judo Club Pep Rally
Next, a contributing teacher to
the Judo Club will give a speech.

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:10.210
Next, a contributing teacher to
the Judo Club will give a speech.

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:15.250
I am Ms. Yokoshima,
the student council advisor.

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:18.800
They were a bunch of troublesome students.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:22.390
However, they were worth every effort
I've put into raising them.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.270
You have all...

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.890
grown so much.

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:31.440
Aren't you the <i>English</i> teacher?!

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:33.480
Why are you taking the credit for yourself?

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:35.900
<i>I'm</i> the one who taught them.

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:39.400
Next, each Judo Club member will say a few words.

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:41.780
Um...

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:43.740
I'll continue to do my best.

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:45.450
How standard.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.160
Your... Your...

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:51.250
Your shupport shell fuel me im my endeafors!

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.130
Can't enunciate.

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:54.590
I'll give it my all, even if it kills me.

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:56.340
What about your entrance exams?

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:59.420
I read in a manga that the
will to live makes you stronger,

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:01.260
so I will live on and work hard!

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:05.010
I believe my biggest enemy is myself, and I'll keep that in mind as I fight!

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:05.720
No, it's the bus.

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:06.640
Isn't it the bus?

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:07.600
It's definitely the bus.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:17.150
Very nice!

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:18.900
These young girls have very nice legs—

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:20.360
No.

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:27.530
As I look up at the cherry blossom-filled sky...

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:28.660
Very nice!

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:30.660
These young girls have very nice lips—

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:33.080
I wasn't even taking photos of their underwear.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:34.920
Still no.

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:37.290
I don't remember this.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:42.010
The boys formed their own group for the occasion.

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:47.470
The choir and the cheerleader team
were wonderful, too.

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:48.930
We all have such high hopes that our ch—

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:54.190
Shino-chan won't like it if I say "chests swell with pride"!

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:56.440
...our tampons swell!

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:57.940
Where'd that come from?!

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:31.450
Thank you all so much!

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:34.290
I... I...

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:35.410
Stop right there, Mitsuba.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:38.460
It's still too early to cry.

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:40.290
You're right.

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:41.840
I should wait until...

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:44.130
I get married!

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:45.590
That's too far ahead!

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:48.010
By the way, Toki-san didn't come?

00:21:48.010 --> 00:21:51.470
Oh, don't worry about her.

00:22:02.310 --> 00:22:04.480
You really don't mind missing the pep rally?

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:08.570
Yeah, I don't like stuff like that.

00:22:09.490 --> 00:22:12.490
I've already convinced the captain
to let me skip it.

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:16.040
Looks like you really don't like it.

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:18.370
Being gang-eye-molested.

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:19.870
That's completely wrong!

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:23.880
SYD Shopping!

00:22:25.380 --> 00:22:28.050
Fall is the season for sports! I wanna do some exercise!

00:22:28.050 --> 00:22:29.380
I have just the product for you!

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:32.760
It's perfect if you want to get plenty of exercise this fall:

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:34.600
the SYD training jersey!

00:22:34.600 --> 00:22:36.140
Whoa, it actually looks okay!

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:43.110
There's even a famous, marathon-winning
international athlete who loves wearing one!

00:22:43.900 --> 00:22:45.650
What marathon is that?

00:22:46.110 --> 00:22:47.150
It's the...

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:49.360
Stan K. Bush Girls Marathon!

00:22:49.360 --> 00:22:50.900
Whoa, hold up!

00:22:50.900 --> 00:22:51.740
Wow!

00:22:51.740 --> 00:22:53.990
The winner of the Stinky Bush Girls Marathon?

00:22:53.990 --> 00:22:54.700
Can we really air this?!

00:22:54.700 --> 00:22:57.200
All right! I'll start wearing one and training hard

00:22:57.200 --> 00:23:00.750
so I can win the Stinky Bush Girls Marathon, too!

00:23:00.750 --> 00:23:01.920
Go for it, Shino-chan!

00:23:02.370 --> 00:23:04.420
Everyone, let's work for that Stan K. Bush!

00:23:04.420 --> 00:23:06.420
One of you had better
apologize for this, and quickly!

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:12.010
And if you call now for this SYD training jersey,
it'll only cost 19,194 yen!

00:23:12.010 --> 00:23:13.220
I'm calling soon!

00:23:13.220 --> 00:23:18.270
If you want your own, call 69-0721-***!

00:23:18.270 --> 00:23:20.930
That's sixty-nine, oh-septuum, triple anal!

00:23:20.930 --> 00:23:23.150
Tsuda Kotomi here!

00:23:26.650 --> 00:23:27.940
Do the preview properly!

00:23:27.940 --> 00:23:30.030
Next time, the guest will...

00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:32.950
I'm an idol!

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:35.030
At least keep the format!
